          "settings": {
            "text": "<h5>4. Earn</h5><p><strong>Level 1 |</strong> $10 Credit: Share 2 Loulou Lollipop in-feed posts.</p><p><strong>Level 2 |</strong> $25 Credit: Share 5 Loulou Lollipop dedicated in-feed posts.</p><p><strong>Level 3 |</strong> $40 Credit: Share 7+ Loulou Lollipop dedicated in-feed posts.</p><p>Earn 10% commission on every sale made through your storefront.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
